# Command prettier

## What does this command do:

Opinionated code formatter for JavaScript, TypeScript, CSS, HTML, JSON, Markdown, YAML, GraphQL, and more — enforces consistent style with zero config required

## Installed from

For Fedora install using: `npm install -g prettier`

To upgrade: `npm install -g prettier@latest`

## Command path

For Fedora run: ~/.local/bin/prettier

## Command documentation

Docs can be found at https://prettier.io/docs/en/cli.html

## Command options

# --- Check and format ---

# Format a single file (writes in-place)
prettier --write src/index.ts

# Format all files matching a glob
prettier --write "src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}"

# Check if files are already formatted (exits 1 if not)
prettier --check "src/**/*.ts"

# List files that differ from formatted output
prettier --list-different "src/**/*.ts"

# Format stdin, output to stdout
echo "const x={a:1}" | prettier --parser babel

# --- Config ---

# Use a specific config file
prettier --config .prettierrc --write "src/**"

# Pass config inline (overrides .prettierrc)
prettier --single-quote --no-semi --write "src/**/*.ts"

# Ignore a file pattern (uses .prettierignore by default)
prettier --ignore-path .prettierignore --write .

# --- Common format options ---

# Print width (default 80)
prettier --print-width 100 --write .

# Tab width (default 2)
prettier --tab-width 4 --write .

# Use tabs instead of spaces
prettier --use-tabs --write .

# Trailing commas: all | es5 | none (default: all)
prettier --trailing-comma es5 --write .

# Single quotes (default: false — uses double)
prettier --single-quote --write .

# No semicolons
prettier --no-semi --write .

# Bracket spacing: { a: 1 } vs {a:1} (default: true)
prettier --no-bracket-spacing --write .

# Arrow parens: always | avoid (default: always)
prettier --arrow-parens avoid --write .

# End of line: lf | crlf | cr | auto (default: lf)
prettier --end-of-line lf --write .

# --- Specific parsers ---
# prettier auto-detects parser from file extension; override when needed:
prettier --parser babel          # JS/JSX
prettier --parser typescript     # TS/TSX
prettier --parser css
prettier --parser markdown
prettier --parser yaml
prettier --parser json
prettier --parser html

# --- Project setup ---

# Generate a default .prettierrc
echo '{}' > .prettierrc

# Create .prettierignore (same syntax as .gitignore)
# node_modules
# dist
# build

# Check version
prettier --version

# Show effective config for a file
prettier --find-config-path src/index.ts
